<title>POLAND: BRE NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 9.12 MLN.</title>
<headline>BRE NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 9.12 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  9.12 vs   10.56</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    9.04 vs   14.07</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 24.36 vs   22.45</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	41.41 vs   33.82x</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					126.03 vs   94.74</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				  181.00 vs  153.45</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		295.43 vs  250.27</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     446.45 vs  332.56</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Rozwoju Eksportu SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
